  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Defensive mountain army rebuilding after the 2020 war and the 2023 loss of Nagorno-Karabakh. Has frozen participation in the Russian-led CSTO since 2024 (stopped paying dues, skips all events; not formally withdrawn as of 2026, though the government says it will leave when it decides) and is diversifying to India (Pinaka, ATAGS, Akash) and France (Bastion APCs, CAESAR, radars). Russia's 102nd base at Gyumri remains. Peace treaty with Azerbaijan initialled in Washington (Aug 2025) but unsigned; Pashinyan's party kept its majority in June 2026 but lacks the constitutional majority Baku demands.",
    "squad_size": 8,
    "fireteam": "Soviet-pattern squad of 8-9; game 8 in pairs.",
