  "notes": "Neutral, Western-leaning client in the Caucasus. Real 2026 status: Armenia-Azerbaijan peace treaty initialled (Washington, August 2025) but unsigned; the 'Trump Route for International Peace and Prosperity' (TRIPP) transit corridor through southern Armenia is under development with US participation; Armenia keeps its CSTO membership frozen and is in a public dispute with Russia while staying in the EAEU. In game: contracts for Armenia lock out Azerbaijani contracts for a while (and vice versa).",
